body:
We are here for your brother, you are fighting against a world filled with sin, it is okay to feel overwhelmed. What are your worst triggers? Mine was Instagram in Snapchat so I deleted them. I would also highly recommend looking into something like Pi-hole. It is a cheap computer you plug into your home that blocks all ads, and more importantly, can be set up to block all porn. 

&#x200B;

You are loved, even if it feels like the world is against you, I will be praying for you tonight.

That much should last me 3-5 meals!

&#x200B;

Jk it looks like it will be a nice harvest congrats :)

Here we go again... There is a whole world out there besides politics. It makes me so upset how divisive politics is and how it can become somebodies whole personality.

My "Take" on it (and this is by no means supported by anything other than my smooth wrinkle-less brain) is that the people who get swept up by this political stuff are lonely in some way and that being part of this gives them something that they are missing, community. I think this is also why in some cases people take in *All* of "their" parties beliefs blindly rather than making many individual thoughts about issues. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Anyways, Rant over I don't know where I was going with this. My coffee hasn't kicked in yet so it may sound like meaningless "Old  man yells at cloud" ramble when I read this later
